{"ahead_by":1,"behind_by":0,"files":[{"filename":".changeset/cinatoken-gateway-postgres.md","patch":"@@ -1,5 +0,0 @@\n----\n-\"cinatoken\": minor\n----\n-\n-启动 `cinatoken_gateway` PostgreSQL 迁移：安全改名历史 Schema，补齐门户整数账本与链上事务 Outbox 迁移，统一 PostgreSQL 运行时 search path，并将 D1→PostgreSQL ETL/对账升级为覆盖当前数据模型、源冻结、目标离线、会话失效和失败关闭的生产迁移流程。Proxy、Admin/Portal 与 Chain Worker 现可通过同一个 Cloudflare Hyperdrive 绑定显式切换到 PostgreSQL；默认仍保持 D1，缺失或不一致的切换配置会失败关闭。","status":"removed"},{"filename":"CHANGELOG.md","patch":"@@ -1,5 +1,12 @@\n # Changelog\n \n+## 2.9.0\n+### Minor Changes\n+\n+\n+\n+- [`7e876cf`](https://github.com/cinagroup/cinatoken/commit/7e876cfb048e98e619cbc97b5712c1d21cdb8a5b) - 启动 `cinatoken_gateway` PostgreSQL 迁移：安全改名历史 Schema，补齐门户整数账本与链上事务 Outbox 迁移，统一 PostgreSQL 运行时 search path，并将 D1→PostgreSQL ETL/对账升级为覆盖当前数据模型、源冻结、目标离线、会话失效和失败关闭的生产迁移流程。Proxy、Admin/Portal 与 Chain Worker 现可通过同一个 Cloudflare Hyperdrive 绑定显式切换到 PostgreSQL；默认仍保持 D1，缺失或不一致的切换配置会失败关闭。\n+\n ## 2.8.0\n \n ### Minor Changes","status":"modified"},{"filename":"package.json","patch":"@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@\n {\n \t\"name\": \"cinatoken\",\n-\t\"version\": \"2.8.0\",\n+\t\"version\": \"2.9.0\",\n \t\"private\": true,\n \t\"repository\": {\n \t\t\"type\": \"git\",","status":"modified"},{"filename":"packages/admin/CHANGELOG.md","patch":"@@ -1,5 +1,13 @@\n # @octafuse/admin\n \n+## 2.9.0\n+### Patch Changes\n+\n+- Updated dependencies []:\n+  - @octafuse/core@2.9.0\n+  - @octafuse/tool-engines@2.9.0\n+  - @cinatoken/web@2.9.0\n+\n ## 2.8.0\n \n ### Patch Changes","status":"modified"},{"filename":"packages/admin/package.json","patch":"@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@\n {\n \t\"name\": \"@octafuse/admin\",\n-\t\"version\": \"2.8.0\",\n+\t\"version\": \"2.9.0\",\n \t\"private\": true,\n \t\"scripts\": {\n \t\t\"dev\": \"npm run build:tools-css \u0026\u0026 next dev\",","status":"modified"},{"filename":"packages/core/CHANGELOG.md","patch":"@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@\n # @octafuse/core\n \n+## 2.9.0\n+\n ## 2.8.0\n \n ## 2.7.0","status":"modified"},{"filename":"packag